{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-820", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/820", "wordCount": 1258, "segments": [{"start": 21.0, "text": "Today I am going to talk"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "about iMessage apps."}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "The iMessage App Store is only a"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "year old, and there are already"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "so many great apps, and so many"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "new experiences."}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "There are also many more yet to"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "be discovered."}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "An essential part of the"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "iMessage App experience is"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "Stickers. Stickers have done so much to"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "brighten our conversations."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "There are so many different"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "types of Stickers, even animated"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "ones."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "Look at all the Stickers here."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "And these are only the Apple"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "ones."}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "Let's take a look at what makes"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "them so great."}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "Going to jump into a"}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "conversation, and my friend sent"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "me this image of a show that we"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "went to. I'm going to react with a"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "Sticker."}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "Going to pick this thumbs-up one"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "here, tap and hold to peel, and"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "put it where I want it, scale,"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "rotate, and drop it there."}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "I'm going to add another"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "Sticker, just to be extra fun"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "with it."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "Pick this one."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "And I think I'm going to send"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "this one with a full screen"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "effect."}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "This new echo one that Mac"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "worked on is great."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "What makes the Sticker"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "experience so effective is that"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "it's flexible."}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "With the expandable App drawer,"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "I can use the half screen and"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "full screen view to find exactly"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "the Sticker that I want."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "It is fast."}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "It is easy, and light."}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "In other words, it's convenient."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "Prior to Stickers, you could not"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "respond to an older bubble in"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "the conversation, and you"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "definitely couldn't overlay"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "images on top of bubbles."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "That is a game changer."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "I could pick my Sticker, and put"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "it exactly where I want it,"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "transforming the conversation"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "for both of us to enjoy."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "Using Stickers is playful, and"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "personal."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "There are so many different"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "types of ways to send Stickers,"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "expressing yourself in unique"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "and colorful ways is fun."}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "That animation is so cool."}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "We've seen how being convenient,"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "personal and fun are part of"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "what makes Stickers such a great"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "But what works for Stickers can"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "also work for other apps."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "Like expressive apps, sharing"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "apps, and collaborative apps."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Let's focus on expressive apps."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "Here is one that I love."}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "Tumblr. Tumblr's iOS app is a"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "social media destination"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "optimized for sharing photos and"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "gifts, but that doesn't"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "necessarily translate into"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "person to person communication."}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "So they made something"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "different."}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "They made a GIF generator."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "Going to jump into another app"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "here, and pick a video that I"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "made."}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "Cool. I can set the playback"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "behavior, and speed it up a"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "little bit."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "My friend is having a bad day,"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "so I'm going to send him a fun"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "little message."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "Bounce back, Homey!"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "I could pick the color."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "And change the font."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "Scale and rotate."}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "Get that frog in there, nice."}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "And send it."}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "Tumblr made a robust GIF editor"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "allowing you to trim your video,"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "control the play speed, and set"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "playback behavior."}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "It is so powerful, and lives"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "right within messages."}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "The whole process is lightweight"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "and convenient."}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "You can also customize text,"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "setting the font style, color,"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "scale and rotation to"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "personalize your GIF."}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "All these decisions make your"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "GIF special for both you and the"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "person you're sending it to."}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "And it's fun to see the GIF that"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "you just created looping in your"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "conversation."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "I know this is going to get a good reaction."}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "We've seen how Tumblr has made a"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "robust, expressive app that is"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "so different from Stickers, yet"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "it maintains the core qualities"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "of a successful iMessage app."}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "Let's see how it works for a"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "sharing app."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "Here is an awesome app."}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "Dunkin Donuts."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "Their iOS app is filled with all"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "kinds of stuff."}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "You can see your rewards, find"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "locations, see the menu, order"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "drinks."}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "But all these features don't"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "necessarily translate into a"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "conversational experience."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "But one part definitely does."}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "Gift cards. Going to go in here."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "My friend just helped me move,"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "so I'm going to send him a gift"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "card."}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "And he was kind of lazy, so I'm"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "only going to send him five"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "bucks."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "Going to pick the right gift"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "card. How about \"You're one in a"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "million\"?"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "That is kind of silly, right?"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "And use the Apple Pay sheet, and"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "boom, just like that."}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "I just sent a gift card."}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "Apple Pay allows you to perform"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "financial transactions without"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "leaving messages."}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "It is super convenient."}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "These cards look really nice."}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "Maybe it's your nephew's graduation or a friend's"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "birthday, or you want to let"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "someone know that you're"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "thinking about them."}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "Sending a gift card is a great"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "way to do it."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "Everyone loves donuts."}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "And giving is fun."}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "Being kind is fun."}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "The person receiving this is"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "probably going to be really"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "surprised."}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "So the Dunkin Donuts app is so"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "different than Stickers and"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "Tumblr, it still works well"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "because it embodies the same"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "three qualities."}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "There are also collaborative"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "apps, like games and polling."}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "Games and polling rely on both"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "parties to participate, to make"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "the most of the app experience."}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "I'm going to share with you one"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "of my favorite apps."}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "Tinder. Tinder is a popular"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "dating app, but you're probably"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "asking yourself how does a"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "dating app find its way into"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "messages?"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "One of the core features of"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "Tinder is Stacks."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "A data can upload a set of"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "images, or create a stack, to"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "attract potential connections."}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "I am going to go here and create"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "a stack."}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "I'm having a little personal"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "crisis today, so maybe my friend"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "could help me. I really need to know what shoes"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "I should wear today."}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "Going to pick my images, name my"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "stack, and vote on my own stack."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "I really love all of these, so"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "hopefully I can get some help."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "Then I just sent a poll."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "Imagine if you had to create a"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "poll without using this app."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "You would have to send these"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "images individually."}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "And how would people vote for"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "them? They would have to say leather"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "boots, or yellow sneakers."}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "But here, they could just cast"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "their vote."}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "Making polls with Tinder is so"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "easy."}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "I have the Tinder app just so I"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "could use this feature"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "."}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "Taking a poll is personal."}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "You're sharing a personal set of"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "images, selfies, sneakers, food,"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "or whatever, you're asking a"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "trusted person for their opinion"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "because you care."}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "And it's fun."}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "It's fun to pick people's"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "brains. It's fun to agree and disagree."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "The poll evolves as people vote,"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "and becomes an enjoyable event"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "for everyone."}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "So whether you're making a"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "sticker pack, a GIF generator, a"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "gifting experience, or an image"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "poll, making them convenient,"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "personal and fun can make a huge"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "difference in the success of"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "Here are some tips to get"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "started."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "Tumblr, Dunkin Donuts and Tinder"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "do not set out to put their"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "entire apps into messages, and"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "thankfully they didn't."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "They integrated only features"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "that were focused on"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "communication."}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "Handcrafted messages are fun to"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "send and receive."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "Find ways to let your users"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "create and customize the"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "You may find that there are ways"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "to use your app that you never"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "even imagined."}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "You may discover new user bases,"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "like my experience with Tinder."}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "There are so many platform"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "tools, peel and place stickers,"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "Apple Pay sheet, access to the"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "microphone, camera and photos."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "Think about what is best for"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "your app, and improve on an"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "existing experience, or create a"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "new one."}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "Because in the end, you want to"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "create a wonderful experience"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "for your family and friends."}]}
